# 📚 BUNK BUDDY PRO
### Smart Attendance Management Solution for SCT

> **Live Demo:** https://bunk-buddy-pro.netlify.app
> **Built by:** Shahid U (U11SZ24S0179) - BCA Final Year 2024-25
> **College:** Seshadripuram College, Tumakuru

---

### 🔥 What is Bunk Buddy Pro?

Bunk Buddy Pro answers every student's question: **"Kitna bunk kar sakte hai?"**

A private, fast, mobile-friendly web app that calculates your attendance percentage instantly and tells you how many classes you can safely bunk OR must attend to maintain 75%.

### 🎯 Problem Statement

- Students don't know exact % till exam time
- Manual calculation = errors & anxiety
- No private tool for SCT students
- 75% criteria confusion = risk of year loss

### ✨ Features

- 🔐 **Secure Auth:** UUCMS ID based registration & login
- 🧮 **Instant Calc:** P = (Attended/Total)*100
- 🔮 **Smart Prediction:** Safe bunks & required classes
- 🔒 **100% Private:** Your data = only visible to you (UUCMS_bunkData key)
- 👨‍🏫 **Admin Panel:** Overall stats for faculty
- 📱 **Responsive:** Works like an app on mobile

### 🧠 Key Formulas

```javascript
percentage = (attended / total) * 100

if (percentage >= 75) {
  canBunk = Math.floor((attended - 0.75 * total) / 0.75)
  // "You can bunk 2 more classes safely!"
} else {
  mustAttend = Math.ceil((0.75 * total - attended) / 0.25)
  // "You must attend next 5 classes!"
}
